experiment dist9b_arms:
objective: distribution shift of the compiled conclude edit and its same-norm placebo (merged Q6_K files, provenance = the compile report) and of the conclude control vector and its placebo at scale 1.0, all against the 9B base's saved logits
steps:
    step bench_run suite=dist-shift model=hf_cache/cc_op_v2/merged-Q6_K.gguf base=hf_cache/h4/A0-Q6_K.gguf arm=merged out=lab/runs/bench/dist9b_merged.json provenance=hf_cache/cc_op_v2/report.json
    step bench_run suite=dist-shift model=hf_cache/cc_op_v2/placebo_merged-Q6_K.gguf base=hf_cache/h4/A0-Q6_K.gguf arm=placebo_merged out=lab/runs/bench/dist9b_placebo_merged.json
    step bench_run suite=dist-shift model=hf_cache/h4/A0-Q6_K.gguf base=hf_cache/h4/A0-Q6_K.gguf arm=vec_1.0 out=lab/runs/bench/dist9b_vec.json control_vector=hf_cache/cc/cc_v2.gguf scale=1.0
    step bench_run suite=dist-shift model=hf_cache/h4/A0-Q6_K.gguf base=hf_cache/h4/A0-Q6_K.gguf arm=placebo_vec_1.0 out=lab/runs/bench/dist9b_placebo_vec.json control_vector=hf_cache/cc/cc_v2.placebo2026.gguf scale=1.0
